# Reference-building GLB bytes live in the bim public Blob store
# (quick-260916-0bz) and are served through the next.config.ts rewrite.
# scripts/restore-reference-glbs.mjs re-materializes local copies for
# dev/test; they must never be uploaded into a Vercel build (dirty-deploy
# OOM defense — 470 MB OOM'd the standard builder twice).
public/reference-buildings/**/*.glb
